{"availability":"available","full":"purplepincher/deckboss","name":"deckboss","description":"DeckBoss — a voice-first, offline-first fishing logbook. Local-first; syncs only to storage you own. purplepincher's flagship product.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-02T21:12:01Z","updated":"2026-10-08T23:01:52Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://purplepincher.github.io/deckboss/","topics":["fishing","indexeddb","local-first","offline-first","pwa","react","typescript","voice-recognition"],"demo":"https://purplepincher.github.io/deckboss/app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T14:53:14.069Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T14:53:14.069Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T14:53:14.069Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T14:53:14.069Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A voice-first fishing logbook: tap to record, and timestamp, GPS, and transcript are captured automatically. It's a Progressive Web App (PWA) — a website you install on your phone's home screen like an app, that keeps working with no signal at all. Recordings queue on your device and sync later, whenever you're back in range. Runs entirely in the browser, and syncs only to storage you own — Google Drive, Cloudflare R2, Oracle Object Storage, or a plain .zip export. No PurplePincher server ever holds your logs.","DeckBoss is a personal log, not a substitute for official or regulatory catch reporting. The additive-corrections design (see Design principles below) exists because it makes offline sync conflict-safe, not because this has been reviewed or certified as evidence-grade for licensing or compliance purposes — it hasn't. Don't rely on it for anything a regulator or insurer needs to accept as authoritative."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/purplepincher/deckboss/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"b1e5d18cf6aba11e92c09cc55da524bc195bb3d741165aa8